OL,3,GNEWSAMan was covered in blood after
OL,4,Akilling partner, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was found covered in blood hours
OL,7,Fafter he allegedly killed his partner,
OL,8,Fa court has heard.
OL,10,FAlexander Brennan, 54, denies murdering
OL,11,FBrodie MacGregor, 23, in her flat in
OL,12,FGlasgow's Springburn on 26 August 2024.
OL,14,FThe trial at the High Court in Glasgow
OL,15,Fheard Brennan was wearing a
OL,16,Fbloodstained jumper and had injuries to
OL,17,Fhis hands and face on the day of the
OL,18,Fsuspected murder.
OL,20,FFragments of glass and blood were also
OL,21,Ffound on clothing belonging to
OL,22,FMacGregor.
